{"t":"Barbarian Axe Quest","s":"barbarian-axe-quest-e021f","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_01_de7abb.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Barbarian Axe Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(40 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The orcs on <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> guard their equipment well in their underground hideout.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave\">Edron Orc Cave</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Snakes, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leaders</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarian%20Axe\">Barbarian Axe</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scimitar\">Scimitar</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> (Advisable, not necessary)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave\">Edron Orc Cave</a> through a hole in the basement of Edron Flats.</li>\n<li>Head south, facing <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen,<a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a> on the surface and go down the hole leading into a cave near the southern most coast.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dark Armor Quest Map 01\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"255\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_01_de7abb.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>On this floor you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>. Follow the arrow down the hole.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Barbarian Axe Quest Map 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Barbarian_Axe_Quest_Map_2_d79d99.jpg\" width=\"197\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>On this floor you will encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a> and probably one or two lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Barbarian Axe Quest Map 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"246\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Barbarian_Axe_Quest_Map_3_1ecadf.jpg\" width=\"207\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Once down this hole you will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>. To save supplies, it is best to stand in the bottom left corner, so that only 3 monsters can hit you at a time. It is advisable to kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a> first.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Barbarian Axe Quest Map 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"210\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Barbarian_Axe_Quest_Map_4_cf0faf.jpg\" width=\"206\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Continue with caution!</b> Right after going down the hole, you will encounter 3 - 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>, so it is advisable to use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a>. Follow the arrow, and beware of more <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>. As you head south into the final room, you will have to face 3+ <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leaders</a> and 2-3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>. Open the box at the southern end of the room to claim your reward.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["against-the-spider-cult-quest"]}